<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Aug palm oil exports 715,550 tonnes - Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Aug palm oil exports 715,550 tonnes - Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's August bulk palm oil exports at 715,550 tonnes against its estimate of 667,802 for July, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put July exports at 646,017 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
